[{"client_msg_id":"6c1b0797-8a23-483b-bb70-81bba1d2e622","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"記事中の引用を意訳すると「GCはヒープとして新たに確保した量で決まる」が正確です。","ts":"1626836045.328800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kyN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3669b701-05b0-4e68-9acb-e925a6327651","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど","ts":"1626835895.326900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0+TAk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f13b3df1-88e5-4385-b529-c4d2685536d2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あ、もちろん「OOM Killを回避するという観点からは」です。","ts":"1626835872.326500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uu9zs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"556ea269-3180-4b50-853e-9589930c5154","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"情報量ゼロなのか…??","ts":"1626835838.325800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MN++L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0934c2f9-cd4d-43e8-a166-f3d38d9fa905","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; Go の GC は純粋に仮想メモリ空間上の使用量で決まる\nこれ、情報量ゼロな上に、あんま参考にならないんです。理由は二つです。\n\nGoに限らず 常にVSS ⊇ RSS ですから、VSSベースだと言ってしまえば極論としては間違いではない。ただ実際にはコンテナのOOMはRSSで適用されるので、そう結論付けちゃうとなにも対策できなくなる。\n\n加えて、GoはVSS上にヒープオブジェクト以外に広大なメモリ管理領域を確保してます。それはカウントされてないので語弊を生じてしまう。","ts":"1626835770.325400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626836436.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vaQ=4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7502504a-78ab-47f4-8566-1e9439384902","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Docker をつかっている前提としてそもそもスワップアウトが起きないというのはそうか。はい。","ts":"1626835470.321600","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1626835479.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sLFG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fb98d0a-5e72-42d1-97f4-888b324ba1b2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"つまり Go の GC は純粋に仮想メモリ空間上の使用量で決まるのかなと思いました","ts":"1626835440.321100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ffe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a4e8a41-d967-4b0d-8561-db6622b4e388","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ページはアロケートされてる、ただし物理メモリ上にない、だからやっぱRSSに組み入れか。","ts":"1626835429.320800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626835438.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"znEVS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e546dc75-0c80-4d17-b0a0-7a92c86c002f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; OSが数えてるRSSからは除外されるはず\nいやどうなのかな","ts":"1626835391.319800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626835408.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mPW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7194d835-149f-4b1c-9974-0f58c91ef418","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはGoのGC的には考慮できない(≒カウントされる)ですね。OSが数えてるRSSからは除外されるはずですが。とはいえ前提となってるコンテナでRSS制限かけてる状況でスワップアウトというのは現実的ではないかなと。","ts":"1626835372.319600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8zVQm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c684de2-d50b-4f0b-b293-60962eadaa42","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"「値が入っているがスワップアウトされているもの」もカウント対象ではあるんじゃないんですか? そうではない?","ts":"1626835007.317600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Re9f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05fee740-ccf3-4d23-95d5-312c5d6e3fd6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど","ts":"1626834616.316900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zl4G4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42917148-b81f-41ae-964c-a63380bcd76f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ですよね。いまざっとみてるんだけど、Go上での認識しているサイズであって、RSS一致ではなさそう。\n\n「GCの対象となるオブジェクトは何らかの値が入ってるもの」って捉えてたのでRSSの一部と答えたんですが、大きな実初期化配列みたいなのはページインしてないVSSのままという例外があるのを失念していた。","ts":"1626834542.316200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626834596.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T=rtY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35bd8299-448d-4e8b-846f-334b261b29cc","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"物理メモリカウントじゃない気がしますね","ts":"1626834444.314900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rnb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"102f7cd7-329e-4227-8952-5534309819b0","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あの無意味にスライス確保して GC 抑える記事から察するに","ts":"1626834435.314500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DAe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3af5df5-9f36-428f-9206-7c236d1e2daa","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやGoの仕組み考えたらカウントされそうな気もするな。","ts":"1626834255.314000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"20oQO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c2abb55-5753-488e-99ea-712e66f1b5ad","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そういうsliceってheap_markedにカウントされないのかしら","ts":"1626834216.313500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tNXu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eec42009-0c50-440e-b568-7d66eb0d12bf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うーん確実とは言えないけど。","ts":"1626834166.312600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e1C6+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"199f2e8f-2369-429d-82ef-c45156d8bce9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"すると単に make しただけの巨大スライス (RSS くわないやつ) は影響なし?","ts":"1626833475.311900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X11n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21901f27-e84f-49fe-91bc-22b890fe8f65","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"正確に言うと「最後のGCの時にmarkされたheap上のオブジェクトのバイト数」なのでRSSではあるけど、GoのラインタイムがRSSに持ってるもの全部ではないです。","ts":"1626833308.311200","thread_ts":"1626833308.311200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FDk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc1038d9-755c-4a83-bc28-128de4435544","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"RSSの一部、です。","ts":"1626833115.310100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2OH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ef9316c-9575-44b8-a778-68814e9bdd47","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; GOGC環境変数はGCのターゲット割合の初期値を設定します。前回のGC完了時に割り当て済みだったメモリ量に対して、この割合のメモリ量が新たに追加で割り当てられた際に次回のGCを実行します。デフォルトはGOGC=100(倍のメモリが割り当てられたら)です。\nこれって結局 RSS なんですっけ、仮想メモリなんですっけ?","ts":"1626798574.309200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"krX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2eb2a68d-4ac5-424e-bc87-2844befda3fb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://zenn.dev/koron/articles/b96cccfa82c0c1\u003e\n\u0026gt; GoはいつGCするのか?","ts":"1626793806.308700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626793817.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V+q/c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50132403-cd96-4f0f-b6c7-cd5da0a2f0c2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"展開されないな?","ts":"1626793804.308500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+aBa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f703749-b7eb-4df6-b5dc-2a928fa17c60","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1417501795442511872\u003e","ts":"1626793789.308100","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya|@kaoriya\u003e: GoとDockerとOOMの記事、第3弾です\n\n\u003chttps://zenn.dev/koron/articles/b96cccfa82c0c1\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"MURAOKA Taro","author_subname":"@kaoriya","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1417501795442511872","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1196794099/avatar_normal.JPEG","text":"GoとDockerとOOMの記事、第3弾です\n\n\u003chttps://zenn.dev/koron/articles/b96cccfa82c0c1\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626793738,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1417501795442511872","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1417501795442511872"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0IVWV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96e68a85-d2bf-419e-b51a-8c01727763db","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"メモリ管理用のarenaとかあるので","ts":"1626833344.311300","thread_ts":"1626833308.311200","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ty47V"}]}]
